From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jordan Bettcher <thebettcher@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:06:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] [engine] build: add the missing get_host_byteorder.py

build/config/host_byteorder.gni runs
exec_script("//build/config/get_host_byteorder.py") when host_cpu is
"ppc64", but the script was never copied over from Chromium's build/,
so any ppc64 host fails at `gn gen` (via //flutter/third_party/icu).
Add Chromium's two-line script.

Class: upstreamable fix.
---
 engine/src/build/config/get_host_byteorder.py | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)
 create mode 100755 engine/src/build/config/get_host_byteorder.py

diff --git a/engine/src/build/config/get_host_byteorder.py b/engine/src/build/config/get_host_byteorder.py
new file mode 100755
index 00000000..6ffea59c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/engine/src/build/config/get_host_byteorder.py
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+# Copyright 2017 The Chromium Authors. All rights reserved.
+# Use of this source code is governed by a BSD-style license that can be
+# found in the LICENSE file.
+
+"""Get Byteorder of host architecture"""
+
+import sys
+
+print(sys.byteorder)
